{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065316/block/singleImage/3275888/df/01M84DG635WM6DKN3F57MC9Z2M.png?updatedAt=1795444769\"/><figcaption>案件交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進。</figcaption></figure><p>今日（23日）下午3時許，新蒲崗一名47歲姓孫女子前往大有街一間銀行，並出示多張美金現鈔辦理存款手續。銀行職員點算及查驗期間，驚覺當中一張美鈔疑為偽鈔，隨即報警求助。 警方接報趕抵現場，經初步調查後，以涉嫌「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕該名47歲女子。被捕女子現正被扣留調查，案件交由黃大仙警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T15:56:49.516557+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:39:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:53:33.939387+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T15:50:13.406715+00:00","content_hash":"c47f9096b4a0ba6da4f3e3f878de4683b1f55f9115ec5b8379a737d600751f73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}